nd captains over every one of them."],"ref":"Exodus 14:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"And he took","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" six","strong":"H8337"},{"text":" hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" chosen","strong":"H977"},{"text":" chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":", and all the chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":" of Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":", and captains","strong":"H7991"},{"text":" over every one of them."}]},{"id":1897,"title":"Exodus 14:8","segments":["And the LORD hardened the heart of Pharaoh king of Egypt, and he pursued after the children of Israel: and the children of Israel went out with an high hand."],"ref":"Exodus 14:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" hardened","strong":"H2388"},{"text":" the heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" of Pharaoh","strong":"H6547"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":", and he pursued","strong":"H7291"},{"text":" after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":": and the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" went out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" with an high","strong":"H7311"},{"text":" hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":1898,"title":"Exodus 14:9","segments":["But the Egyptians pursued after them, all the horses [and] chariots of Pharaoh, and his horsemen, and his army, and overtook them encamping by the sea, beside Pihahiroth, before Baalzephon."],"ref":"Exodus 14:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"But the Egyptians","strong":"H4714"},{"text":" pursued","strong":"H7291"},{"text":" after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" them, all the horses","strong":"H5483"},{"text":" [and] chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":" of Pharaoh","strong":"H6547"},{"text":", and his horsemen","strong":"H6571"},{"text":", and his army","strong":"H2428"},{"text":", and overtook","strong":"H5381"},{"text":" them encamping","strong":"H2583"},{"text":" by th